id: searx-repository-audit
title: "Audit and harden source, packaging, documentation, and repository security"
description: "Inspect the full codebase and release surface for actionable defects, security gaps, stale guidance, and maintainability improvements."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: audit,docs,packaging,quality,security
