close_reason: All actionable audit findings were fixed and tested; the larger architecture improvement is explicitly governed as a future Feature.
body: "Review source trust boundaries, shell execution, URL/file handling, package contents, documentation, release scripts, workflow permissions, and GitHub security controls. Fix actionable issues and create detailed future items for larger improvements."
